    "media:imagetext": "WE PUT EVERYTHING\nBUSINESS TRAVELERS\nWANT IN JUST\nONE LETTER.\nINTRODUCING TWQ BUSINESS SERVICE.\nAt TWA®, we know what business travelers want from an airline. And\nwe've put it all in our TW Business Service, currently available\nfrom St. Louis to/from Chicago-O'Hare, New York-La Guardia and\nWashington National with more markets to come. The \"O\" is what\nmakes it different, with advantages like:\nQ\nuick service, with close-in permanent gates and Trans World®\nElectronic Ticketing at the gate.\nQuality treatment, including preferred coach seating to assure\nthat the first several rows of coach are reserved for Platinum\nand Red cardholders. Plus dedicated representatives assigned\nto TWQ gates specifically to assist business travelers.\nQ\nuantity of conveniences, like first-flight-out/last-flight-in\nschedules from Chicago, New York and Washington, D.C. to\nSt. Louis, and more daily service than any other airline. We'll\neven provide complimentary Wall Street Journals on morning\nTWQ flights.\nOne letter, with so many benefits. And look for more TWQ services\nto come. Because as long as you're traveling on business, we'1l make it\nour business to earn yours.\nTWQ\nBUSINESS SERVIC\nWE WANT TO BE YOUR AIRLINE\"\nTWA",
